Route38_Text_SailorHarryIntro::
	.string "I’ve been overseas, so I know\n"
	.string "about all sorts of POKéMON!$"

Route38_Text_SailorHarryDefeat::
	.string "Your skill is world class!$"

Route38_Text_SailorHarry::
	.string "All kinds of people around the\n"
	.string "world live happily with POKéMON.$"

Route38_Text_BirdKeeperTobyIntro::
	.string "Fly high into the sky, my beloved\n"
	.string "bird POKéMON!$"

Route38_Text_BirdKeeperTobyDefeat::
	.string "I feel like just flying away now.$"

Route38_Text_BirdKeeperToby::
	.string "I plan to train in CIANWOOD CITY to\n"
	.string "teach my POKéMON how to fly.$"

Route38_Text_Lass122Intro::
	.string "Are you good at training?\p"
	.string "If you are, could you show me how?$"

Route38_Text_Lass122Defeat::
	.string "I see. So you can battle that way.$"

Route38_Text_Lass122::
	.string "I know something good!\p"
	.string "MOOMOO FARM’s milk is famous for its\n"
	.string "flavor.$"

Route38_Text_BeautyValerieIntro::
	.string "Hi! Aren’t you a cute trainer!\n"
	.string "May I see your POKéMON?$"

Route38_Text_BeautyValerieDefeat::
	.string "I’m glad I got to see your POKéMON!$"

Route38_Text_BeautyValerie::
	.string "When I see POKéMON, it seems to\n"
	.string "soothe my nerves.$"

Route38_Text_Schoolboy285Intro::
	.string "Let me try something I learned\n"
	.string "today.$"

Route38_Text_Schoolboy285Defeat::
	.string "I didn’t study enough, I guess.$"

Route38_Text_Schoolboy285::
	.string "I have to take so many tests, I\n"
	.string "don’t have much time for POKéMON.\p"
	.string "So when I do get to play, I really\n"
	.string "concentrate.$"

Route38_Text_Man_1::
	.string "ARTHUR: Who are you?\p"
	.string "I’m ARTHUR of Thursday.\p"
	.string "Here. You can have this.$"

Route38_Text_Man_2::
	.string "ARTHUR: A POKéMON that uses rock-\n"
	.string "type moves should hold on to that.\p"
	.string "It pumps up rock-type attacks.$"

Route38_Text_Man_3::
	.string "ARTHUR: I’m ARTHUR of Thursday. I’m\n"
	.string "the second son out of seven children.$"

Route38_Text_Sign1::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "If a POKéMON is trying to evolve,\n"
	.string "you can stop it.\p"
	.string "Press the B Button during evolu-\n"
	.string "tion.\p"
	.string "That startles the POKéMON and stops\n"
	.string "its evolution.$"

Route38_Text_Sign2::
	.string "ROUTE 38\n"
	.string "OLIVINE CITY - ECRUTEAK CITY$"
